  "content": {
    "id": "p43-q4",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "The perimeter of a printed rectangular photo is 50 cm.\nThe length is 5 cm longer than the width. Use $l$ for length and $w$ for width.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p43-q4-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Explain why $l + w = 25$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The perimeter is $2l + 2w = 50$. Dividing by 2 gives $l + w = 25$.",
          "worked": "A rectangle has two lengths and two widths, so its perimeter gives\n$$\\begin{align*}2l + 2w &= 50\\\\l + w &= 25\\end{align*}$$\nThe second equation follows by dividing both sides by 2.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 16
      },
      {
        "id": "p43-q4-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Explain why $l = w + 5$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The length is 5 cm longer than the width, so \n\n$l = w + 5$.",
          "worked": "Adding 5 cm to the width gives the length, so $l = w + 5$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 12
      },
      {
        "id": "p43-q4-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Solve the two equations simultaneously and hence state the dimensions of the photo.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Width 10 cm, length 15 cm.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}l + w &= 25 &&\\text{(1)}\\\\l - w &= 5 &&\\text{(2)}\\end{align*}$$\n(1) + (2):\n$$\\begin{align*}2l &= 30\\\\l &= 15\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute $l = 15$ into (1):\n$$\\begin{align*}15 + w &= 25\\\\w &= 10\\end{align*}$$\nThe photo is 15 cm long and 10 cm wide.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 54
      }
    ]
  },
